  "endPos": 862,
  "detail":
  "```lean\nStd.Format.group : Lean.Format → optParam Std.Format.FlattenBehavior Std.Format.FlattenBehavior.allOrNone → Lean.Format\n```\n***\nCreates a new flattening group for the given inner format.  \n***\n*import Init.Data.Format.Basic*",
  "definitionStartPos": {"line": 75, "column": 4},
  "definitionPath":
  "/Users/hattoriseiji/.elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.10.0-rc2/src/lean/Init/Data/Format/Basic.lean",
